      "originalText": "how it's measured: bench --picker-latency drives the real PickerApp on an InMemoryTerminalBackend, types \"windows terminal settings\" one key at a time 40 times,\nand times key -> the frame whose rows show that keystroke's results. a real terminal's own paint time is not in the number.\nrefuses to start when stdout is redirected (exit 2): live widgets leak spinner frames into piped output",
